{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Rail Defence: Eldritch Siege</strong></i> is the long-anticipated sequel to the creative Tower Defense game <i><strong>Loopstructor</strong></i>. Building on the original's signature <i>Loop-based Tower Defense</i> mechanics, this game pushes the concept further than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/73532e694680a2932ec3603894d64567.poster.avif?t=1769182219\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/73532e694680a2932ec3603894d64567.webm?t=1769182219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/73532e694680a2932ec3603894d64567.mp4?t=1769182219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Loop-based Tower Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a mysterious steampunk world warped by the influence of hidden <strong>Rail Gods</strong> , design rail networks, deploy and upgrade unique <strong>Battle Trains</strong> , and harness new systems such as <strong>Rail Enchantments</strong> to transform your mobile fortresses into devastating engines of defense. Every decision matters, and every move could mean survival \u2014 or collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/127c5215ccde1461bdeb5d43df7a59f1.poster.avif?t=1769182219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/127c5215ccde1461bdeb5d43df7a59f1.webm?t=1769182219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/extras/127c5215ccde1461bdeb5d43df7a59f1.mp4?t=1769182219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Strategy</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamically shifting battlefield with endless tactical combinations tests your planning and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High Replayability</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock diverse trains, unique bases, and powerful relics to craft your own tactical builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Planning</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Preview maps and plan your strategy direction \u2014 play defensively and develop your base or fight aggressively to grow stronger, it's all in your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add <strong>Rail Defence: Eldritch Siege</strong> to your Steam Wishlist today! Prepare yourself, as your rails will be the final line of defense against the unspeakable.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841840?t=1769182219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841840?t=1769182219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/8e534d81a388ab3fb68fdee3350d15f43824f247/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769182219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841840/8e534d81a388ab3fb68fdee3350d15f43824f247/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769182219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"